Ena sunonthuleuma demosiographon mias kathemerines ephemeridas pou de noiazetai toso gia ten plerophoria oso gia ekbiasmous, laspologies kai phtenes istories. Enas paranoikos suntaktes pou anabionei penenta khronia Istorias upo to phos mias satanikes plektanes me epikentro to ptoma enos pseuto-Mousolini se aposunthese. Stis skies paramoneuei e mustike dexia Epikheirese Gladio, e masonike Stoa R2, to praxikopema tou prigkipa Tzounio Balerio Mporgkeze, e CIA, kai eikosi khronia sphages kai sugkalupses. Mia khliare istoria agapes anamesa se enan apotukhemeno aphane suggraphea kai ena enokhletiko koritsi to opoio, gia na boethesei ten oikogeneia tou, ekhei paratesei to panepistemio kai askholeitai me ta roz koutsompolia. Ena teleio egkheiridio kakes demosiographias, opou o anagnostes arkhizei siga siga na anarotietai an prokeitai gia muthoplasia e piste apotupose tes pragmatikotetas. Mia istoria pou ektulissetai to 1992 -khronia pou prooionisteke polla musteria kai aperiskepsies ton epomenon eikosi eton-akribos te stigme pou oi duo protagonistes nomizan oti o ephialtes eikhe teleiosei. Ena pikro kai gkrotesko epeisodio pou lambanei khora sten Europe kata ten periodo meta te lexe tou polemou kai phtanei mekhri to semera - ena epeisodio pou tha kanei ton anagnoste na aisthanthei toso khamenos oso kai oi duo protagonistes."½
ºAmerike, 1951. Deuteros khronos tou polemou tes Koreas. O Markous Mesner, meleteros, nomotages kai pathiasmenos nearos apo to Niouark tou Niou Tzerzi, einai deuteroetes phoitetes sto sunteretiko, threskeutikon katabolon panepistemio tou Gouainsmpergk, sto Okhaio. Giati den brisketai sto topiko panepistemio tou Niouark opou eikhe arkhika eggraphei; Aitia einai o pateras tou, romaleos khasapes tes geitonias, aphosiomenos ste sklere douleia, pou deikhnei na men mporei na elegxei ton phobo kai ten anesukhia tou gia tous kindunous pou pisteuei oti apeiloun ton agapemeno tou gio: tous kindunous tes enelikes zoes kai tou kosmou, pou paramoneuoun se kathe gonia.
Opos exegei ston Markous e metera tou, thuma kai e idia autes tes paraloges sumperiphoras, oi phoboi tou patera opheilontai sten agape kai ten uperephaneia pou aisthanetai gi' auton. Isos na einai etsi, alla aute e katastase kanei ton Markous na aganaktei toso pou den antekhei pia te sumbiose me tous goneis tou.
Egkataleipei to patriko tou, kai, makria apo to Niouark, s' ena panepistemio ton Mesodutikon Politeion, anazeta ton dromo tou mesa sto plaisio pou orizoun ta ethe kai oi periorismoi enos diaphoretikou amerikanikou kosmou.
E "Aganaktese", to eikosto enato biblio tou Philip Roth, aphegeitai ten istoria enos neou anthropou pou diaplathetai mesa stis tromaktikes sugkuries kai ta paradoxa empodia pou orthonei mprosta tou e zoe. Einai mia istoria gia ten apeiria kai ten anoesia, gia ten pneumatike antistase, gia ten aphupnise tes sexoualikotetas, gia to tharros kai ten plane, dosmene me ton eurematiko, zontano kai pneumatode tropo tou Roth.
O suggrapheas egkataleipei ta themata pou stoikheionan ta proegoumena erga tou, ta gerateia kai ten peira tes zoes kai strephetai me duname ste diereunese tou tropou pou epidra e amerikanike istoria ste zoe ton eualoton anthropon."Ì
ÉStous Daktulious tou Kronou, sto deutero kata seira pezographiko ergo tou W.G. Sebald, o aphegetes peridiabazei tis araiokatoikemenes kometeies tou Norpholk kai tou Saphpholk, sten anatolike akte tes Agglias.
Ton Augousto, ton mena pou sumphona me tis doxasies briskotan anekathen upo ten epidrase tou Kronou, o aphegetes diaskhizei tous anthismenous ereikones, episkeptetai tis remagmenes epauleis tes upaithrou kai tis doxasmenes politeies tou makrinou parelthontos, kai skontaphtei diarkos pano se paradoxes kai thaumastes istories, ap' opou anaduontai oi lampres epokhes ton arkhontikon tes biktorianes epokhes, oi sphodres makhes anamesa stis allotines europaikes uperdunameis, o pinakas anatomias tou Remprant, stigmiotupa apo te zoe tou Tzozeph Konrant, o atukhos erotas tou Satomprian e e istoria tes metaxourgias apo tis aparkhes tes sten Kina os ten uiothetese tes apo to Trito Raikh.
Me diaugeia kai akribeia katagraphei, sugkhronos, tis sioperes katastrophes pou suntelestekan me ten epembase tou anthropou se toute ten ereme ge. E odoiporia tou pairnei etsi te morphe mias monakhikes litaneias pou diatrekhei san arrekto metaxoto nema ten poreia tou politismou kai tes phuses, opou tipote den antekhei ston khrono kai opou e kathe morphe katasparazei ten proegoumene gia na katatarakhthei kai e idia apo ten epomene. Pano se kathe nea morphe epikathetai o iskios tes katastrophes.
Me alla logia, e istoria kathe anthropou, kathe koinonikes taxes pragmaton, alla kai tou kosmou oloklerou, den xetuligetai pano se ena kalogrammeno toxo pou oloena platainei me ten parodo tou khronou, alla diagraphei mia trokhia e opoia molis draskelisei ton Mesembrino katrakula pros to erebos.
Anazetontas tis rizes tes anthropines exousias, o Zempalnt diapistonei pos oso pio phantakhtera einai ta mesa pou e idia khresimopoiei pros epideixe toso perissotero kurieuetai apo ten agonia men tukhon kai apolesei ten pantokratoria pou ekhei sugkentrosei sta kheria tes me toso katastrophiko mokhtho, se mian apotukhemene prospatheia na mimethei te phuse, pou nomoteleiaka alethei ston mulo tes katheti pou ekhei plasei noritera."Ï
Ì"Einai ena muthistorema me thema ten eukharistese pou niothoume otan diabazoume muthistoremata. Protagonistes einai o Anagnostes pou arkhizei deka phores na diabazei ena biblio kai pou logo kapoion gegonoton anexarteton apo te boulese tou, den katorthonei na teleiosei pote. Khreiasteke epomenos na grapso ten arkhe deka muthistorematon grammenon upotithetai apo deka suggrapheis, pou oloi kata kapoion tropo etan diaphoretikoi apo mena kai diaphoretikoi metaxu tous..."
Me ta logia auta o Italo Kalbino parousiase sto Mpouenos Aires to muthistorema tou auto pou xaphniase, suzetetheke kai telikos agapetheke oso kanena apo ta erga tou. To "An mia nukhta tou kheimona enas taxidiotes", uperxe okhi mono mia axeperaste sponde sto logotekhniko eidos tou muthistorematos alla kai to ergo pou anoixe neous dromous gia te logotekhnia tou 21ou aiona."Ö
ÓMia apo tis adunamies tou Ntostogiebske dinei morphe sumbolike, kheiropiaste, s' o,ti einai e idia e ousia tou Einai tou: e arrostemene mania gia ta tukhera paikhnidia. Apo mikro paidi ekhei to pathos tes khartopaixias - alla mono sten Europe anakaluptei to diaboliko kathrephte tes neurikotetas tou: to Kokkino kai to Mauro, te rouleta, auto to toso epikinduno paikhnidi mesa ston protogono duismo tou. E prasine tsokha tou Mpanten, e rouleta tou Monte Karlo einai oi entonoteres ekstaseis tou sten Europe: ton upnotizoun pio polu apo te Mantona tes Sixtina, apo t' agalmata tou Mikhael Aggelou, apo ta mesembrina topia, apo ten tekhne kai ton politismo oloklerou tou kosmou. Epeide ekei briskei ten entase, ten telesidike apophase: mauro e kokkino, mona e zuga, eutukhia e ekmedenise, khasoura e kerdos - sumpuknomena sta deuterolepta ekeina pou e roda gurizei: e entase sugkentromene mesa se auten ten astrape tou ponou e tes apolauses, opos te lakhtaraei e idiosugkrasia tou."Û
Ø"E despoinida" einai mia Serba pou anaptussei drase tokogluphou prin apo kai kata ten diarkeia tou Protou Pagkosmiou Polemou. Gia tous sumpolites tes einai "ena plasma dikhos kardia kai axioprepeia, mia exairese gia ton gunaikeio plethusmo tes poles, kati san monterna magissa..." Aneraste, agelaste, dikhos khara kai dikhos aisthemata philias kai agapes akoma kai gia ten idia te metera tes, blepei tous allous mono os sumballomenous stis diarkeis sunallages tes kai mono etsi tous anagnorizei. Skiagraphontas to portreto autou tou "thelukou Sailok", o Ibo Antrits olokleronei ten katagraphe ton istorikon gegonoton kai ten perigraphe tes idiaiteres patridas tou, tes Bosnias, gia mia periodo pou xeperna ta 400 khronia -mia katagraphe pou xekinese me ta alla duo aristourgematika muthistoremata tou, "To gephuri tou Drinou" kai "To khroniko tou Trabnik"."İ
Úna ergo kharitomeno, xekardistiko, mia anarkhike satira. Kai piso ap' ol' auta enas problematismos pano sto musterio tou sumpantikou Kakou.
Antartes aggeloi katebainoun ste ge, pairnoun anthropine morphe kai sunomotoun pos na rixoun apo to throno tou to Theo kai na baloun ste these tou ton Eosphoro. Merikoi aggeloi blepontas pos pano ste ge ta pragmata einai ta idia kai kheirotera xekhnoun ten apeleutherose ton ouranon kai rikhnontai me zelo stous koinonikous agones.
Omos o upertatos arkhegos olon, o protos exegermenos, den einai katholou komikos eroas. O Eosphoros, prosopo kathara dramatiko, den ekhei edo kamia skhese me ton paradosiako diabolo. Einai to sumbolo tes apeleutherotikes gnoses kai tes gonimopoiou exegerses."á
ŞAthena, 1929. O mathematikos Stephanos Kantartzes brisketai nekros sto domatio tou. O epistethios philos tou, epises mathematikos, Mikhael Igerinos, kaleitai gia na anagnorisei to ptoma. Orthios mprosta ston nekro philo tou, o Igerinos anapolei ta kapou trianta khronia tes gnorimias tous* ten prote tous sunantese, s' ena mathematiko sunedrio to 1900, tis parees tous me ten aban gkarnt tes parisines dianoeses, tis periplaneseis tous sto Parisi tes Mpel Epok, tous Balkanikous Polemous, to Dikhasmo, te Mikrasiatike Katastrophe. Thumatai tis thuellodeis mathematikes tous diaphonies, tous erotes tous, tis polemikes tous peripeteies. O ekhos mias rombias ton epanapherei sto paron. To erotema einai epitaktiko; Poios skotose ton Stephano Kantartze, kai kurios giati ton skotose;
Astunomike peripeteia me entono mathematiko aroma, campus novel e muthistorema epokhes, ta "Puthagoreia egklemata" aphegountai ena phantastiko egklema me phonto ena alethino, semantro kai mathematiko problema."ã
àE ennoia tou paralogou kai e skhese anamesa sto paralogo kai ten autoktonia apoteloun ta themata autou tou dokimiou. Apo te stigme pou o anthropos paradekhetai te diastase anamesa ste logike epithumia tou gia katanoese kai eutukhia kai ste siope tou kosmou, mporei arage na krinei an e zoe axizei ton kopo na ten zei kaneis; Touto einai to themeliodes erotema tes philosophias. An omos to paralogo mou phainetai prodelo, opheilo na to diatereso me mia diauge prospatheia kai na dekhto na zeso bionontas to. E exegerse mou, e eleutheria, to pathos mou, tha einai oi sunepeies tou. O anthropos, sigouros oti tha pethanei oloklerotika, arnoumenos omos to thanato, lutromenos apo ten uperphusike elpida pou tou edene ta kheria, tha mporesei na gnorisei to pathos tes zoes s' enan kosmo dosmeno sten adiaphoria tou kai ste phtharte omorphia tou. Omos e demiourgia einai gia ekeinon e kalutere eukairia gia na diaterei te suneidese tou agrupne mprosta stis lampres kai alogistes eikones tou kosmou. O agonas tou Sisuphou pou periphronei tous theous, agapa te zoe kai misei to thanato ginetai to sumbolo tes anthropines moiras."å
âEnas anthropos khanei xaphnika to phos tou. Ta peristatika aiphnidias tuphloses klimakonontai kai e kubernese apophasizei na balei se karantina tous tuphlous. Me grapheiokratike akribeia, o Zoze Saramagkou ekhei upologisei ola osa tha mporousan na sumboun s' enan kosmo pou khanei ten orase tou.
Gia poso kairo e kinese stous dromous tha einai omale; Gia poso kairo tha eparkoun ta trophima gia tis peinasmenes ordes; Posos khronos khreiazetai gia na katarreusei e parokhe elektrikou reumatos, aeriou kai nerou; Ti th' apoginoun ta katoikidia; Oi sexoualikoi phragmoi; Posoi tuphloi phtiakhnoun mia tuphloteta;"è
åSto "Oneiro" o Saixper katapianetai to erotiko thema me thaumaste mastoria ki eleutheria. Plekei ten istoria tou me anthropina plasmata olon ton taxeon, basiliades, astous, lao, daimonia kai xotika paramuthenia, pou oloi kai ola briskontai se mian eugenikia kai kalobole oikeioteta skheseon metaxu tous, kai sunthetei mia erotike istoria toso kharitomene, toso plemmurismene m' euphrosune diathese, pou den ekhei to omoio tes. O poietes magemenos ki o idios apo te mageia tes phuses kai tes niotes, skubei me sugkatabatike agape ste phtene anthropine zoe, ten anebazei sto magiko patari tes skenes kai te photizei me to zoero phos tes ugeias, tes agnotetas, tes athootetas, tes phusikes eugeneias kai deikhnei mian anthropoteta lampre, akome kai me ten komike tes opse, katholou romantike, mustikistike, para gere, tharrete, eleuthere, ten anthropoteta tes anagenneses."è	
å	Ten 4e Iouliou tou 1862, enas nearos diakonos, o opoios didaske Mathematika sto kolegio tes Christ Church sten Oxphorde, pege ekdrome mazi me ta tria koritsakia tou Presbuterou. E euthume parea ekane barkada mekhri arga to apogeuma, me gelia, khares, tragoudia kai istories. Kai, ekeine ten axiomnemoneute mera, mesa sta eliolousta nera tou potamou, gennetheke e Alike. E Alike, e eroida pou emelle na ginei thrulike oso e Stakhtopouta kai e Khionate, pou tha latreuotan apo genies olokleres kai tha goeteue ekatommuria anagnostes kathe khoras kai kathe elikias. Ta duo biblia tou Liouis Karol pou proekupsan, semera einai pia klasika. Sto proto, to "E Alike ste khora ton thaumaton", e mikre eroida khanetai s' ena sageneutiko oneiro, se mia paramuthenia khora* sto deutero, to "Mesa ap' ton kathrephte", zei tis pio paraxenes peripeteies se mia anestrammene pragmatikoteta. Grammena me khioumor kai trupheroteta, panexupna, euaistheta kai poluepipeda, ta erga auta ploutizoun oposdepote ton tropo pou ekhoume na blepoume kai na skeptomaste ta pragmata. Semera, to "pneuma" tes Alikes apotelei stoikheio anapospasto tes europaikes koultouras: tha exakolouthei gia panta na muei sto thaumasto kosmo tes phantasias kai na empneei tis eperkhomenes genies."ê
çO Max Mpront, epistethios philos tou Phrants Kaphka, ekrine oti to "Gramma ston patera", (1919), apotelei logotekhniko ergo. Prokeitai gia keimeno apoluta prosopiko pou pragmatika apeuthunotan ston patera tou suggraphea -khoris pote na epidothei. E axia tou "Grammatos ston patera" sunistatai sten katholikoteta tou, giati xeperna ta oria tes tragikes zoes tou suggraphea. An o anagnostes psaxei, tha brei oti to keimeno ton aphora amesa kai sugkhronos apotelei ena kleidi gia ten katanoese tou kaphkikou ergou. Koinoniologoi, psukhanalutes, theologoi brekan s' auto to gramma ten trophe pou gureuan. O anagnostes khoris na tous agnoesei, sebomenos to drama tou Kaphka, prepei na tous xeperasei kai na meinei antimetopos me to Phobero Agnosto."ì
éTo biblio auto einai e katagraphe, me mikres diorthoseis kai sumpleroseis, tessaron dialexeon pou organothekan ston Armo, me titlo Megalonontas mesa sten oikogeneia. E summetokhe tou koinou uperxe poluplethes kai zontane, me polles eroteseis, pou katagraphontai sto biblio mazi me tis apanteseis tou omilete.
Einai polu gnosto kai apodekto semera oti e paidike elikia kathorizei se semantikotato bathmo ten ole anaptuxe tes prosopikotetas kai ten poreia tes zoes tou kathe atomou. Sta keimena perigraphontai ta stadia tes psukhosexoualikes anaptuxes tou paidiou, apo ten sullepse, ten embruike periodo kai ta epomena stadia, mekhri ten prote oloklerose tes prosopikotetas guro sta 5-6 khronia.
"To paidi einai o pateras tou enelikou" eipe o Freud, ennoontas oti oi empeiries tou paidiou kathorizoun ten prosopikoteta tous otan einai enelikos. Asphalos paizoun rolo kai oi kleronomikes kataboles, alla gi' autes den mporoume na kanoume akome kati ousiastiko. Gnorizoume omos semera, apo ten Psukhanaluse ki alles skhetikes epistemes, ton terastio, kathoristiko rolo ton gonion - kai to biblio epikentronetai akribos s' auto to rolo. Ti einai sosto, ti lathos ste sumperiphora ton gonion; Pos e sumperiphora aute kathorizetai apo ten dike tous paidike elikia;
Kuklophoroun polla biblia gia ta paidia, polla kala kai polla epiphaneiaka e lathemena. E idiaiteroteta tou bibliou autou einai e psukhanalutike proseggise se sunduasmo me ta neotera dedomena ton Neuroepistemon, oste na prospherei lita kai katanoeta sto euru morphomeno koino tis sugkhrones sostes epistemonikes apopseis gia ten anatrophe ton paidion.
(Apo ten parousiase tou ekdote)"ğ
íTo "Na zeis, n' agapas kai na mathaineis", einai ena apo ta kalutera kai pio poludiabasmena biblia tou Leo Mpouskalia. Einai enas olokleros thesauros kai mia ateleiote pege empneuses, tharrous kai apophasistikotetas gia olous osous anazetoun mia kainouria diastase sten prosopikoteta tous kai ste zoe tous mesa apo tous dromous tes katanoeses kai tes agapes. Kathegetes tes paidagogikes sto Panepistemio tes Notias Kaliphornias, psukhologos kai sunarpastikos omiletes, o Mpouskalia se kathelonei kai se metamorphonei me ta biblia tou, pou ola skhedon pegazoun apo omilies, dialexeis kai eleutheres suzeteseis mesa kai exo apo tis panepistemiakes aithouses, "phonazei, mimeitai, gela, dakruzei kai klaiei", graphei enas skholiastes kai sumpleronei: "To na parakoloutheis to Mpouskalia na mila einai san na koubentiazeis m' enan palio philo pano s' ena koino kai potheto thema''."ô
ñEna sunarpastiko gaitanaki me axona ten psukhotherapeia einai to deutero muthistorema tou diasemou Amerikanou psukhiatrou kai psukhotherapeute Irbin Gialom. O suggrapheas apokaluptei sto blemma tou koinou ti sumbainei mesa sto grapheio alla kai ste skepse ton psukhotherapeuton, te zoe tous, tis duskolies tous, ten anthropine upostase tous. To khioumor kai e lepte eironeia kuriarkhoun kai enallassontai me dektikes perigraphes ekprosopon tou psukhiatrikou kosmou. Oso omos apomuthopoiountai oi psukhotherapeutes, e goeteia tes psukhotherapeias auxanetai. O Gialom ten parousiazei kato apo neo phos: einai mia suntrophike poreia pros ten epiteuxe mias alethines anthropines epaphes. Me kinematographiko tropo, sunekheis anatropes kai astunomiko saspens, o Gialom analuei sto Ntibani tou te sugkhrone koinonia kai tis anthropines skheseis. Sto Ntibani einai e eleuthere apodose tou agglikou titlou Lying on the Couch. O Gialom kanei edo ena ametaphrasto logopaignio me treis diaphoretikes semasies: delonei prota ap' ola ten anaklise tou analuomenou sto psukhanalutiko ntibani, os sumbolo tes psukhotherapeias. Uponoei te sexoualike praxe metaxu therapeuomenou kai therapeute, ena apo ta kentrika ethika problemata pou tithentai kai ermeneuontai mesa sto biblio, kai telos anapheretai sten apokrupse kai ste diastreblose tes aletheias, sto psema pou mporei na eiskhoresei sten psukhotherapeutike diadikasia. O suggrapheas katapianetai methodika kai me ta tria auta zetemata, entassontas ta organika se mia muthoplasia sunarpastike. Sto proto tou muthistorema, Otan eklapse o Nitse, o Gialom askholetheke me ten psukhotherapeia sten embruike tes morphe, kathos aute skhematizotan mesa sto soma tes philosophias ste Bienne tou telous tou 19ou aiona. Sto Ntibani paraterei to epaggelma tou psukhotherapeute ekato khronia argotera, mesa sto phutorio tes amerikanikes koinonias, opou, epeita apo pollous peiramatismous, anaptukhthekan ta poikila eide tes psukhotherapeias tou 20ou aiona. To Ntibani einai epises ena exairetiko mosaiko tes amerikanikes koinonias: to khrema, e poluteleia, e mataiodoxia, o atomikismos, e epithetikoteta, alla kai e alle opse tous: e monakhikoteta, e mataioteta, e elleipse storges, e kataphuge ste khrese ousion, perigraphontai me akribeia alla kai me katanoese."ù
öTo tsirko phthanei khoris proeidopoiese.
Den ekhoun proegethei anaggelies, oute aphisetes stous stulous kai tous pinakes anakoinoseon sto kentro tes poles, oute anaphores e diaphemiseis stis topikes ephemerides. Einai apla ekei, eno khthes den etan.
Mesa se autes tis aspromaures rige skenes pou zontaneuoun te nukhta, perimenei mia monadike empeiria, mia giorte ton aistheseon, opou mporei kaneis na khathei se ena laburintho apo sunnepha, na periplanethei se ena khloero kepo apo pago, na dei magemenos mia akrobatissa olo tatouaz na truponei se ena gualino kouti, na niosei mia uperokhe zalada apo tis murodies tes kanelas kai tes karamelas pou gemizoun ton aera.
Kalos erthate sto Le Cirque des Reves.
Ma piso apo tous kapnous kai tous kathrephtes ektulissetai mia dunamike sugkrouse -enas diagonismos anamesa se duo nearous ilouzionistes, te Silia kai ton Marko, pou apo paidia ekpaideuontai se ena "paikhnidi" sto opoio tous ekhoun pagideusei khoris diaphuge oi idiorruthmoi aphentes tous. Oi paiktes den xeroun oti ap' auto to paikhnidi mono enas tha bgei zontanos, kai oti to tsirko einai aplos e skene gia mia ekplektike makhe theleses kai phantasias.
Kathos to tsirko taxideuei se oloklero ton kosmo, ta magika katorthomata ginontai oloena kai pio euphantasta se kathe stathmo tou. To paikhnidi sunekhizetai kai oi zoes oson ekhoun anamikhthei -metaxu allon, o ekkentrikos idioktetes tou tsirkou, e ainigmatike kontorsionistria, e musteriake khartomantissa, ta kokkinomallika diduma pou gennethekan sta paraskenia- parasurontai se mia plemmura apo magika kai xorkia.
Otan omos e Silia anakaluptei oti antipalos tes einai o Marko, arkhizoun na blepoun to paikhnidi okhi san mia anametrese alla san mia uperokhe sunergasia. Dikhos na gnorizoun to prokathorismeno telos, eroteuontai. Einai enas bathus, pathiasmenos kai magikos erotas pou kanei ta phota na tremopaizoun kai ta domatia na thermainontai kathe phora pou molis aggizoun ta kheria tous.
Alla oi daskaloi tous exakolouthoun na kinoun ta nemata, kai aute e aproblepte exelixe tous anagkazei na paremboun me epikindunes sunepeies pou thetoun se kinduno tis zoes olon, apo kallitekhnes mekhri theates."ú
