øOtan ton rotesa "ti na sou metaphraso ellenika", den einai tukhaio to gegonos oti o Nerouda mou zetese na metaphero ellenika to "Estrabagario" tou - aphou koitakhteke me paraxene khara me te Matilnte, me ten opoia xephonisan skhedon mazi: "El Estrabagario, natouralmente!" Oute einai tukhaio to gegonos oti to aphierono ston megalo tes poieses mas, ton Gianne Ritso. To "Estrabagario" einai leptaistheta luriko-khioumoristiko, san na 'rkhetai apo klimata san to diko mas kai, otan to 'graphe, san na eniothe polu Ellenas, olon ton epokhon. Einai biblio duspepto gia anthropous ligotero thremmenous me aisthetikes kai pneumatikotetes polu diulismenes, gia anthropous pou den ekhoun demiourgesei to Dialogo, opos e sokratike skepse, to piperi opos o Aristophanes, ta bele kai tous exorkismous san ton Laskarato e ton RoIde, te sullepse apokhroseon kai te dieisdutikoteta san ton Kabaphe...""ü
ùENA MEGALO MUThISTOREMA GIA MIA MIKRE POLE...
Otan o Mpari Phermpader pethainei xaphnika sta saranta tou, e mikre agglike pole Pagkkphornt sugklonizetai. To Pagkphornt einai ena eidulliako meros, kharakteristiko aggliko topio, me mia plakostrote kentrike plateia kai ena arkhaio abaeio, alla piso apo ten eremia kai omorphia tou krubetai mia empoleme pole.
Oi plousioi einai se polemo me tous phtokhous, oi epheboi me tous goneis tous, oi gunaikes me tous antres tous, oi daskaloi me tous mathetes tous... To Pagkphornt den einai katholou auto pou phainetai.
E adeia these tou Mpari sten enoria tha ginei o katalutikos paragontas gia na xespasei o megaluteros polemos pou ekhei zesei pote e pole. Poios tha thriambeusei stis ekloges pou einai gemates pathos, upokrisia kai aprosdoketes apokalupseis;
To proto muthistorema tes Tz. K. Rooulingk gia enelikous tha prokalesei kai tha ekplexei."ÿ
üTi einai, loipon, auto to biblio-ekplexe, pou protoekdotheke sta agglika to 1991, pouletheke se 5 ekatommuria antitupa metaxu 1992 kai 1994, anakerukhtheke to 1994 "Biblio tes Khronias" ste Megale Bretania, me perissotera apo ena ekatommuria antitupa ste diarkeia enos etous, kharise ste suggraphea tou -proen eruthrophrouro sten Kina tou Mao- tis 25.000 lires tou NCR Book Award, katatakhtheke endekato sto 100 biblia pou agapethekan ste Bretania kata ton 20o aiona, se enan katalogo pou perilambanei 13 monon gunaikes ("Times" tou Londinou, 20.1.1997) kai pou ton Septembrio tou 1995 eikhe ede metaphrastei se 28 glosses;
Oi "Agriokuknoi" tes Gioungk Tsangk sunduazoun tis prosopikes anamneseis tes suggrapheos apo ten Kina, opou ezese os ta 26 khronia tes, me uliko 60 apomagnetophonemenon oron me prophorikes aphegeseis tes meteras tes. E suggrapheas apodidei ten oxeia mneme tes meteras tes stis phoberes anakriseis stis opoies ten upebalan os upopte gia antepanastatike drase. Ten eikhan anakrinei peri ta dekapente diaphoretika prosopa pou ten piezan na thumethei leptomeros otidepote eikhe kanei e pei. To autobiographiko auto biblio katagraphei loipon te zoe trion geneon Kinezon gunaikon prin kai meta ten Politistike Epanastase tou Mao, diatrekhontas etsi ekato khronia apo ten prosphate istoria tes Kinas. Kathos e ereme kai metremene proza tes Gioungk Tsangk mas xenagei ston tromo kai sta basana sta opoia upoballetai e oikogeneia tes, pairnoume mia geuse apo ton tromo kai ta basana sta opoia upoblethekan ekatommuria zoes. Edo apodotheke e protophanes epitukhia tou keimenou-marturia: sto oti egeirei entona ta sunaisthemata tou anagnoste -oikto kai phobo kai sumpatheia- me aphorme mia oikogeneiake istoria pou einai tautokhrona e sugkhrone istoria mias terastias khoras."ÿ
üPoios etan o Spinoza; Aute e tharralea morphe tou 17ou aiona, autos o megalophues philosophos pou me to ergo tou eperease ten pagkosmia skepse, kai o opoios se elikia eikositrion eton metatrapeke se aposunagogo gia oloklere ten ebraike koinoteta tou Amsterntam, kathos kai gia ten idia tou ten oikogeneia; Poia etan e esoterike tou zoe; Kai se ti opheilotan, akribos duo aiones argotera, e elxe pou askese ston "philosopho" ton Nazi o Spinoza; Giati leelatesan te bibliotheke tou, alla den ekapsan ta biblia tou; Poio etan to "problema Spinoza" sto opoio anapherontan; Auta ta erotemata apaskholoun edo kai para polla khronia ton psukhiatro kai muthistoriographo Irbin Gialom. Sto sunarpastiko kainourgio tou muthistorema, "To problema Spinoza", den exanthropizei mono ton philosopho alla apokaluptei ten apheteria kai to noema autes tes iskhures ma ainigmatikes emmones.
Estiazei to blemma tou ston Alphrent Rozenmpergk, ton Nazi ideologo pou euthunotan kurios gia to "dianoetiko" programma tou kommatos tou. O Rozenmpergk katatrukhetai apo ten pneumatike kleronomia tou eroa tou, tou Gkaite, apo te stigme pou anakaluptei oti o poietes etrephe thaumasmo gia ton Spinoza: Enan aposunagogo Ebraio, pou e koinoteta tou ton kategorese os airetiko kai gia ton opoio o Rozenmpergk niothei sebasmo kai apothese mazi.
Me tous parallelous bious tou Spinoza kai tou Rozenmpergk, o Gialom rikhnei ena dieisdutiko blemma stous kindunous pou ellokheuoun sten anazetese tes sophias kai stis sumphores pou akolouthoun opoion einai arketa tharraleos -e arketa anoetos- oste na apopeirathei na zesei san philosophos.
O Gialom khresimopoiei ten aphegese os doloma, gia na didaxei. Oi dialogoi tou moiazoun, tis perissoteres phores, me atupes sunedries. Me ton tropo auto, to muthistorema tou khresimopoiei ta tekhnasmata kai tous tropous tes logotekhnias, alla me exologotekhniko stokho. O suggrapheas thelei na apotuposei psukhikes sumperiphores, na anikhneusei aitia kai aitiata, na analusei. E psukhanaluse einai to prisma tou, e ametakinete optike tou. E aphegese aplos o tropos tou na plesiasei to eurutero koino. (SOPhIA NIKOLAIDOU, TA NEA, Bibliodromio, 18/2/2012)
Oxuderkes ki akourastos stis uparxiakes tou anazeteseis, o suggrapheas mas phernei xana antimetopous me themeliode uparxiaka zetemata. Ki eno, opos se olo to ergo tou, o thanatos kai e semasia tou gia te zoe krubetai piso ap' ten kourtina, sto teleutaio tou muthistorema, me okhema to ergo tou Spinoza, o psukhotherapeutes estiazei to endiapheron tou sto kunegi tes eutukhias, to noema tes zoes, ten ethike, ten exousia kai te diaploke logikes kai sunaisthematos. (ERRIKA BARAGKOULE, Psychologies magazine, teukhos Martiou 2012)"€	
ıO Souiters einai mia antiphase gia oles tis epokhes: enas anarkhikos pou douleuei gia ten kubernese, enas eirenistes pou koubalaei oplo, enas khortophagos pou troei saltsa apo khoirino, enas magos tou kubernokhorou pou sikhainetai ta kompiouter, enas kheimarrodes mpon biber pou mporei xaphnika na ginei enas mugiaggikhtos sikhasiares, enas anthropos pou, an kai ekhei mania me te diaterese tes athootetas, kaigetai na xeparthenepsei ten anelike eterothale adelphe tou (gia na eroteutei meta exisou paraphora mia kalogria deka khronia megalutere tou).
Par ola auta, o Souiters den ekhei to paramikro stoikheio amphitalanteuses. Den koubala aplos pistoli. Einai o idios ena pistoli. Akolouthontas loipon ton Souiters kathos gurizei tesseris epeirous me ta eniskhumena takounia tou, phlertarontas me ton erota kai ton kinduno, o Rompins exereuna, prokalei, khleuazei kai umnei oles skhedon tis pleures tes eumetabletes epokhes mas.
Sto Agriemenoi anaperoi epistrephoun apo kauta klimata, to ebdomo muthistorema tou, o sophos, pneumatodes kai panta tolmeros Tom Rompins mas gnorizei ton pio poluploko kai sunarpastiko kharaktera pou ekhei demiourgesei."	
